            gnome-control-center
Breaks: better-gnome-desktop (<< 0.4.0)
Replaces: better-gnome-desktop (<< 0.4.0)
Description: dock, desktop icons and tray for GNOME
 Deskence (formerly Better GNOME Desktop) adds a dock with folders, files and
 folders on the desktop, application icons (StatusNotifierItem) in the top
 bar, a clipboard history, Keep Awake in the quick settings, an alphabetical
 applications view and title bar button settings to the standard GNOME
 desktop, configured in one application, with presets to move settings.
 .
 It consists of six GNOME Shell extensions owned by this package, a
 desktop icons helper and a settings application. It works in the existing
 GNOME session; extensions installed or updated by this package start after
 the next login.

Package: better-gnome-desktop
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         deskence (= ${binary:Version})
Description: transitional package for deskence
 Better GNOME Desktop was renamed to Deskence. This empty package brings in
 deskence on update and can be removed afterwards. Settings, enabled
 features and desktop icon positions are taken over at the next login.
